        // which is what it has always meant and is no longer the same as
        // "once per entry into this handler" -- a blocked accept re-runs
        // the syscall when it is woken. A call that resumes a handshake
        // this listener already had is that same call coming back.
        if (pending_slot == 0) {
            syscall_test_evidence_record_accept();
