            NetworkCapabilityTakeResult::Empty => {
                // The handshake keeps its place: somebody else holds the
                // one physical receive capability right now, which says
                // nothing about this connection.
                let parked: bool = kernel_listener_set_pending(
                    accept_listener_fd, slot, generation);
                tcp_connection_put(owner);
                // There is no Ready successor to take a Block action, but
                // the parent cannot become Ready until this process exits.
                // Sleep interruptibly in this syscall instead: an RX or
                // timer interrupt reruns it with the parked handshake and
                // its original deadline intact. Re-read other_ready first:
                // a UART interrupt may just have woken the shell that must
                // run before this child can exit.
